@table(border)
| @b{Hyperparameters (\ours)} | >2 LLaMA-7B | >2 LLaMA-13B | >2 LLaMA2-7B | >2 LLaMA3-8B |
| Rank r | 16 | 32 | 16 | 32 | 16 | 32 | 16 | 32 |
| @eqi(alpha) | 32 | 64 | 32 | 64 | 32 | 64 | 32 | 64 |
| Dropout | >8 0.05 |
| Optimizer | >8 AdamW |
| LR | 2e-4 | 1e-4 | 3e-4 | 2e-4 | 2e-4 | 2e-4 | 1e-4 | 1e-4 |
| LR Scheduler | >8 Linear |
| Batch size | >8 16 |
| Warmup Steps | >8 100 |
| Epochs | >8 3 |
| Where | >8 Q,K,V,Up,Down |
